ergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-Level-8\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-8"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-08-28T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"01a2e990d46f63b164d33abec404579b5bc30051","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor Rudra to delegate console interaction to Ui","messageBody":"Extract a dedicated Ui class for console input and output so Rudra no longer mixes user interaction details with command orchestration.\n\nMove the welcome banner, goodbye message, task list rendering, task result messages, and startup error/warning output behind Ui methods while preserving existing console text.\n\nKeep parsing, storage, and task mutation logic unchanged in this increment to make the refactor small, testable, and easy to review.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":173,"deletions":55}}},{"hash":"e086df761a6fdc53a5e60388c51633a286b76cd8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce Parser and Command hierarchy","messageBody":"Refactor Rudra so it parses each user input into a Command object and delegates behavior to concrete command classes instead of a large switch statement.\n\nAdd Parser to validate command formats and construct List, Exit, Todo, Deadline, Event, Mark, Unmark, and Delete commands.\n\nMove task mutation rollback logic into the Command abstraction so command execution remains behaviorally equivalent while reducing Rudra\u0027s responsibilities.\n\nKeep the existing ArrayList-based task container for now so this architectural shift stays focused and can be reviewed independently from a future TaskList extraction.\n","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":398,"deletions":167}}},{"hash":"43e9afe07cad4d27627037fb2734969dcecc4c3d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Organize Rudra classes into Java packages","messageBody":"Move the application entry point under the rudra package and group related classes into command, parser, task, storage, ui, and exception subpackages.\n\nUpdate package declarations and imports throughout the codebase so the class relationships stay the same while the structure becomes easier to navigate and reason about.\n\nAdjust the repo-local UI test runner to compile nested source files and launch rudra.Rudra, and refresh the README path so the documented entry point matches the new layout.\n","tags":["A-Packages"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":120,"deletions":0},"md":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"4df6dfbc46b08859afca0cf4520d76ddae6ae972","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027origin/add-gradle-support\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Gradle"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"chetangent":{"java":1293,"md":628,"fxml":0,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":0,"txt":1}},"authorContributionVariance":{"chetangent":86508.03},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"chetangent":"CS2103T-T17-2 GULL..ETAN"}}
